Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.28,0:21:46.75,Shiina中,Shiina,0,0,0,,马上就会好…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.28,0:21:46.75,Shiina日,Shiina,0,0,0,,すぐに治ま…
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.07,0:21:54.67,Shiina中,Shiina,0,0,0,,那个亲吻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.07,0:21:54.67,Shiina日,Shiina,0,0,0,,そのキースは
